# Suppression file for ASAN/LSAN

leak:QCryptographicHashPrivate::EVP::EVP
# Qt initializes an OpenSSL provider on first hash use and OpenSSL retains a
# small process-wide allocation until termination.
leak:QCryptographicHash::QCryptographicHash
# The pigment registry is a process-wide Qt global and is intentionally kept
# alive until process termination. Its plugin-created color spaces and profile
# graph are therefore reported after the test has completed.
leak:KoColorSpaceRegistry::instance
# Color spaces are lazily instantiated by factories and retained by the
# process-wide registry until shutdown.
leak:KoColorSpaceFactory::grabColorSpace
leak:TextShape::TextShape
# KChart keeps style objects in process-wide caches.
leak:KChart::
# Fontconfig retains a fallback-font pattern allocated while Qt shapes text.
# The allocation is owned by the process-wide fontconfig cache, not Calligra.
leak:FcFontRenderPrepare
